  "ALL_TEXT": "72 EXT. ROAD - DAY \nThe trio are inside a car. VEDA sees the photos of the police \nreport, identifying VASU and RAJU as the dead. He is shell \nshocked and goes blank. GOVARDHAN leans forward to look. \nGOVARDHAN \nVellay Vellay \nSULOCHANA \n(shocked) \nNijam cheppu VEDA... \nVEDA is panicking. He knows he has to convince SULOCHANA, or \nelse he will loose out on the only help they have. He calms \nhimself down. \nVEDA \nPractigal ga aalochinchu... nijanga \nmeme champi unte mee deggaraki \nvachi mari chepthaama... neeto \npolice station ki vachi photos \nchusi velthaama, I am sure \nchanipoindi vaallu kaadhu ani \nantaana???... Naaku vaallu ela \nchani poyaaro thelidu... Ekkada \nmammalni irikisthaaro ani bhayanga \nundi... \nSULOCHANA nods in acceptance. \nVEDA \nMemu godava padindhi veellathone... \nfirst eeyana kottaadu, tharavaatha \neeyana ochaadu venakanundi.... I \ndon\u2019t know asalu veellu etla \nchanipoyaaro..mem kottindhi... \nveelle, kani ela chanipoyaaru... \nSULOCHANA \nasalu kotindhi nuvvaa \nVEDA \nNeney.. em arthamkavadam ledhu . \nnaaku inka ido pedda \nmisunderstanding, daananthata adey \nclear ayipothadi anipisthundi. \nSULOCHANA \nSituation chaala serious VEDA, \npolisula sangathi neeku teyleedhu \nVEDA \nidantha chusthunte aedo pedda kutra \njaruguthunnattu anipiyyatledha \nmeeku? Asalu nijanga champina vaare \nidantha plan chesthunnaru \nekkadinundo... vaallani etla \npattukunedhi? \nSULOCHANA \nGOVARDHAN meedha evidence chaala \nstrong ga undhi \nVEDA \nem cheyyaali ippudu? naakkem \nardhamkaavadam ledhu..mundhu \nevaraina lawyerni kalavaali... \nSULOCHANA \nVaddhu. idhi minister involve ayina \ncase..once nuvvu lopala \nirrukunavante vallu em cheyaleru \nVEDA \n(Panicking) \nMari etlaaaaa!!!! Evaro okaru undi \nuntaaru kadhaa maaku sahaayam chese \nvaaru..lera?? \nGOVARDHAN \nNen chepedhi \nVEDA snubs GOVARDHAN \nVEDA \nNuvvem maatladodhu \nGOVARDHAN looks pissed. SULOCHANA, who has been thinking for \na while, suddenly says \nSULOCHANA \nCHINTHAN BABA ni kaludhaam....state \nlo ayanikanna powerful evaruleru \naayanatho cheppisthe... \nVEDA \nBaba na..SULOCHANA em aindhi neeku \nVEDA and GOVARDHAN seem reluctant, but SULOCHANA forces them \nto, and they reluctantly leave. \nCUT TO:",
